Find massage somewhere else please. The first massage I booked, she canceled last minute. Yes, provider can cancel without any consequence and if patient cancel last minute we need to pay full amount;
The second time I book massage, she never even show up! How ridiculous.
I’ve talked to support on both issues. The support team can’t do anything about it. Very frustrated and angry on the time I spent on these booking and waiting for bookings.
